   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">GDC301 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.3</span>\n<h2>The 8 course learning outcomes (CLO), verbatim</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Exam questions are written against these outcomes — use them as your checklist.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13779 · Decision 1318/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 27/11/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">GDC301 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.3</span>\n<h2>8 chuẩn đầu ra môn học (CLO), nguyên văn</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đề thi được ra theo các chuẩn đầu ra này — dùng chúng làm danh sách tự kiểm.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13779 · QĐ 1318/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 27/11/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>CLO</th><th>Details (verbatim)<br><small>Nội dung (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>CLO1</strong></td><td>Understand and apply core game design frameworks (MDA, Core Loops, Design Pillars) to analyze existing games and design new mechanics</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>CLO2</strong></td><td>Design and document game systems including progression, economy, and balance using industry-standard GDD formats</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>CLO3</strong></td><td>Design player-centric levels that effectively guide, challenge, and teach players through intentional spatial layout and pacing</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>CLO4</strong></td><td>Design characters and combat systems with clear gameplay roles, readable animations, and balanced combat parameters</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>CLO5</strong></td><td>Craft compelling game narratives including premises, themes, and story structures that enhance player experience</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong>CLO6</strong></td><td>Integrate and direct game art assets to create cohesive visual experiences that support gameplay readability</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td><strong>CLO7</strong></td><td>Implement game feel and physics-based interactions including responsive controls, animation states, and satisfying feedback</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>8</td><td><strong>CLO8</strong></td><td>Execute complete game development cycle from concept through production to showcase using iterative design and playtesting methodologies</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13779\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13779</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13779\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13779</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
