   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">GDC301 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.4</span>\n<h2>Textbooks, materials & tools the university names</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Main textbook: <strong>Level Up! The Guide to great video game design</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13779 · Decision 1318/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 27/11/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">GDC301 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.4</span>\n<h2>Giáo trình, tài liệu & công cụ trường quy định</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Giáo trình chính: <strong>Level Up! The Guide to great video game design</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13779 · QĐ 1318/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 27/11/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Material<br><small>Tài liệu</small></th><th>Author<br><small>Tác giả</small></th><th>Publisher<br><small>NXB</small></th><th>Year<br><small>Năm</small></th><th>Edition<br><small>Lần xuất bản</small></th><th>ISBN</th><th>Main<br><small>Chính</small></th><th>Hard copy<br><small>Bản in</small></th><th>Online</th><th>Note<br><small>Ghi chú</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>Level Up! The Guide to great video game design</strong></td><td>Scott Rogers</td><td>Wiley</td><td>2024</td><td>3rd</td><td><code>978-1394298761</code></td><td>✔</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>Unity 6.2 User Manual</strong></td><td>Unity</td><td>Unity</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td><a href=\"https://docs.unity3d.com/Manual/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://docs.unity3d.com/Manual/index.html</a></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>Unity Learn Platform</strong></td><td>Unity</td><td>Unity</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td><a href=\"https://learn.unity.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://learn.unity.com</a></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>Game Design Workshop: A Playcentric Approach to Creating Innovative Games</strong></td><td>Tracy Fullerton</td><td>A K Peters/CRC Press</td><td>2024</td><td>5th</td><td><code>978-1032607016</code></td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Tools</h3>\n<p>- Visual Studio 2019 or later (C# programming language)<br>- Unity Hub and Unity 5 (version 2021.3 LTS or later)<br>- ProBuilder (in Unity)<br>- Git + GitHub (Student Pack)<br>- Figma/Canva (web based)<br>- Draw.io (web based)<br>- Minimum hardware requirement: Windows 10, 64-bit versions, CPU: X64, RAM: 8GB<br>- Students use Unity with their personal email for educational purposes only</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">Materials with no author/ISBN (slides, exercise packs…) are usually internal files you download inside FLM with your FPT account. Buy the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed — page and exercise numbers change between editions.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Công cụ</h3>\n<p>- Visual Studio 2019 or later (C# programming language)<br>- Unity Hub and Unity 5 (version 2021.3 LTS or later)<br>- ProBuilder (in Unity)<br>- Git + GitHub (Student Pack)<br>- Figma/Canva (web based)<br>- Draw.io (web based)<br>- Minimum hardware requirement: Windows 10, 64-bit versions, CPU: X64, RAM: 8GB<br>- Students use Unity with their personal email for educational purposes only</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN (slide, bộ bài tập…) thường là file nội bộ, tải trong FLM bằng tài khoản FPT. Mua đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng — số trang, số bài tập đổi giữa các bản.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13779\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13779</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13779\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13779</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
